{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Individual therapy and coaching for adults seeking clearer direction, calmer stress response, and stronger relationships. Telehealth and in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
  <script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="about.html">Practice</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a class="cta-btn" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Open navigation">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Clearer perspective. Practical change. Quiet confidence.</h1>
          <p class="lead">I’m {{THERAPIST_NAME}} ({{LICENSE}}). I support adults navigating anxiety, burnout, relationships, and life transitions through evidence-informed therapy and practical coaching skills.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="muted" href="#lead-magnet">Free guide: 5 steps to reduce overwhelm</a>
          </div>
          <p class="small">Sessions available in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and via telehealth. Confidential, collaborative, non-judgmental care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="abstract supportive illustration" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="values" id="values">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>How I work — grounded principles</h2>
        <div class="values-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Clarity first</h3>
            <p>I help you name patterns and priorities so change feels intentional, not accidental.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Evidence-informed</h3>
            <p>Therapy integrates cognitive, somatic, and interpersonal practices tailored to your needs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Practical steps</h3>
            <p>Sessions focus on small, usable strategies you can apply between meetings.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="methods" id="methods">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Methods you can expect</h2>
        <p class="intro">I combine structured therapy with coaching-style skill building. Typical methods include:</p>
        <ul class="methods-list">
          <li><strong>CBT & ACT</strong> for anxious thoughts and behavioral change.</li>
          <li><strong>Trauma-informed relational work</strong> to understand safety and attachment.</li>
          <li><strong>Mindful-somatic practices</strong> to regulate stress and build presence.</li>
          <li><strong>Goal-focused coaching</strong> to translate insight into action.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>What clients say</h2>
        <div class="test-grid">
          <blockquote>
            "I came looking for relief from constant worry. Within months I could think clearer and sleep better. Practical, empathetic, and direct." <cite>— A., 34</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote>
            "Working together helped me set boundaries with work and feel more present with my family. I got tools that actually fit my life." <cite>— M., 42</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objections" id="objections">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Common concerns I hear</h2>
        <div class="faq-grid">
          <div>
            <h4>Worried therapy will be vague?</h4>
            <p>Sessions are structured around clear goals and measurable steps. We review progress and adapt as needed.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Not sure it’s the right time?</h4>
            <p>Even small changes compound. We start where you are and keep the pace manageable.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Privacy and record concerns?</h4>
            <p>Treatment is confidential within legal limits. I can explain records, notes, and secure telehealth practices before you decide.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lead-magnet" id="lead-magnet">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Free guide: 5 steps to reduce overwhelm</h2>
        <p>Practical micro-habits you can try this week. Delivered as a concise PDF and brief email series.</p>
        <form id="leadForm" class="simple-form">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Send me the guide</button>
        </form>
        <p class="small">I value your privacy. Your email will only be used to send the guide and occasional practice updates.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" id="cta">
      <div class="wrap cta-inner">
        <img class="avatar" src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="Therapist portrait illustration">
        <div>
          <h2>Ready for a first conversation?</h2>
          <p>Book a 20-minute consultation to see if we’re a fit — no pressure, just a clear way forward.</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <p class="small">Phone: {{PHONE}} • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p class="small">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • {{MODALITIES}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <p class="disclaimer small">Confidentiality note: Content shared in sessions is confidential except where disclosure is required by law (e.g., imminent risk of harm). This site is for general information and does not replace emergency care. If you are in crisis, call local emergency services or your crisis line.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>"} 
